@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+phrase,category,difficulty
+"Yes, Mistress.",Etiquette,easy
+I am here to obey Mistress.,Identity,easy
+I wait until I am addressed.,Etiquette,easy
+I speak only when invited.,Etiquette,easy
+Mistress knows best.,Obedience,easy
+I will do as I am asked.,Obedience,easy
+Good manners please Mistress.,Etiquette,easy
+I keep my eyes on my task.,Focus,easy
+I do not question Mistress's instructions.,Obedience,normal
+I thank Mistress for her patience.,Etiquette,normal
+Mistress sets the rules and I follow them.,Obedience,normal
+"I will be punctual, polite and precise.",Etiquette,normal
+A request from Mistress is never ignored.,Obedience,normal
+I earn Mistress's approval with careful work.,Focus,normal
+I stand when Mistress enters the room.,Etiquette,normal
+"Impatience is rude, and I am never rude.",Etiquette,normal
+I apologise for my mistake and I will correct it at once.,Obedience,hard
+"Mistress has given me a task, and I will finish it properly.",Focus,hard
+"I do not ask for favours, I earn them through obedience.",Obedience,hard
+Every line I write carefully is a small act of respect for Mistress.,Etiquette,hard
+I am grateful that Mistress takes the time to correct me.,Identity,hard
+"Mistress does not repeat herself, so I listen the first time.",Obedience,hard
+"Discipline is a courtesy I owe to myself and to Mistress, and I pay it gladly.",Identity,hard
+"I will not rush, I will not complain, and I will not stop until Mistress is satisfied.",Focus,hard
+"Mistress Vesper expects precision, and I give her nothing less than my full attention.",Focus,extreme
+"When I am told to begin again, I begin again without a single word of protest.",Obedience,extreme
+"I am obedient, attentive and respectful, because that is who I choose to be for Mistress.",Identity,extreme
+Only when every line is perfect and Mistress is content may I leave her presence.,Obedience,extreme
